      "en": "PAPER-MAKING MACHINES; METHODS OF PRODUCING PAPER THEREON; <br><br><b><u>Subclass indexes</u></b><br><br><table><tr><td width=\"70%\">MAKING CONTINUOUS WEBS<tr><td width=\"70%\">Complete machines </td><td><b><b>9/00</b></b></td></tr></tr><tr><td width=\"70%\">Details<tr><td width=\"70%\">wet end, transfer to press section, press section, dryer section </td><td><b><b>1/00</b>, <b>2/00</b>, <b>3/00</b>, <b>5/00</b></b></td></tr></tr><tr><td width=\"70%\">other details </td><td><b><b>7/00</b></b></td></tr></tr></tr><tr><td width=\"70%\">Processes </td><td><b><b>11/00</b></b></td></tr></tr></tr><tr><td width=\"70%\">MAKING DISCONTINUOUS SHEETS </td><td><b><b>13/00</b></b></td></tr></tr></table>",
